00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:37.977
The product-card cache, taken from LRU + single-flight + XFetch in plain Java (L1) to a two-level Caffeine + Redis cache with race-free versioned writes, event-driven invalidation across pods, hot-key protection, CDN surrogate keys and pre-sale warming (L4), Reading time:

