322
00:14:38.769 --> 00:14:40.369
Technique, and How, and Scope.

323
00:14:40.649 --> 00:14:42.847
Single-flight or request coalescing.

324
00:14:43.127 --> 00:14:43.788
How:

325
00:14:44.068 --> 00:14:46.948
Concurrent misses for a key share one in-flight load.

326
00:14:47.228 --> 00:14:47.953
Scope:

327
00:14:48.233 --> 00:14:51.049
Per process (Caffeine does this for get(key, loader)).

328
00:14:51.329 --> 00:14:52.951
Distributed lock on miss.

329
00:14:53.231 --> 00:14:53.892
How:

330
00:14:54.172 --> 00:14:59.868
SET lock:key NX PX 3000: the winner loads, others wait or serve stale.

331
00:15:00.148 --> 00:15:00.873
Scope:

332
00:15:01.153 --> 00:15:03.628
Across pods (costlier; deadline needed).

333
00:15:03.908 --> 00:15:05.252
Stale-while-revalidate.

334
00:15:05.532 --> 00:15:06.193
How:

335
00:15:06.473 --> 00:15:09.951
Keep serving the expired value while one caller refreshes.

336
00:15:10.231 --> 00:15:10.956
Scope:

337
00:15:11.236 --> 00:15:14.180
Needs a soft TTL plus a hard TTL.

338
00:15:14.460 --> 00:15:17.148
Probabilistic early expiration (XFetch).

339
00:15:17.428 --> 00:15:18.089
How:

340
00:15:18.369 --> 00:15:22.977
Each reader refreshes early with a probability that rises near expiry.

341
00:15:23.257 --> 00:15:23.983
Scope:

342
00:15:24.263 --> 00:15:26.545
Across pods, with no coordination.

343
00:15:26.825 --> 00:15:28.788
Refresh-ahead for known hot keys.

344
00:15:29.068 --> 00:15:29.729
How:

345
00:15:30.009 --> 00:15:32.079
Background refresh before expiry.

346
00:15:32.359 --> 00:15:33.084
Scope:

347
00:15:33.364 --> 00:15:34.623
Hot SKUs, config.

348
00:15:35.973 --> 00:15:37.146
TTL jitter.

349
00:15:37.426 --> 00:15:38.087
How:

350
00:15:38.367 --> 00:15:40.181
