422
00:19:21.391 --> 00:19:22.884
Latency: ms.

423
00:19:23.164 --> 00:19:24.380
L1 per pod.

424
00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:26.239
Invalidation mechanism:

425
00:19:26.519 --> 00:19:34.220
Broadcast event (Kafka, per-pod group; or Redis Pub or Sub), then each pod evicts locally; plus a short TTL.

426
00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.356
