427
00:19:36.636 --> 00:19:37.575
CDN.

428
00:19:37.855 --> 00:19:39.433
Invalidation mechanism:

429
00:19:39.713 --> 00:19:46.220
Purge by URL or surrogate key (tag all pages containing SKU X, then purge the tag).

430
00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:48.036
