431
00:19:48.316 --> 00:19:49.489
Browser or app.

432
00:19:49.769 --> 00:19:51.348
Invalidation mechanism:

433
00:19:51.628 --> 00:19:56.001
Cache-Control + ETags; versioned URLs for immutable assets.

434
00:19:56.281 --> 00:19:57.199
Latency:

435
00:19:57.479 --> 00:19:59.889
Next request (or never, if immutable).

436
00:20:01.239 --> 00:20:06.509
The order matters: invalidate from the inside out (L2, then L1, then CDN).

437
00:20:06.789 --> 00:20:11.802
Otherwise an outer layer can re-fill from an inner layer that still holds the old value.

438
00:20:13.152 --> 00:20:14.091
Hot keys.

439
00:20:14.371 --> 00:20:24.739
A single key receiving a large share of traffic (1 rupeesonions product card during the sale) concentrates load on one Redis shard (Ch 06).

