00:26:19.122 --> 00:26:20.530
Context and Problem.

552
00:26:20.810 --> 00:26:33.994
A cache flush at sale start caused a stampede that took down the catalog database, L1 caches served stale prices across pods, and a read or write race pinned a stale price for hours (§1.1).

