00:26:36.882 --> 00:26:53.309
Goals: ≥ 98 % hit ratio at 110 K req per second; price changes visible within 5 s p99; no stale-forever values; survive a cold or lost Redis without taking down PostgreSQL.

556
00:26:53.589 --> 00:27:00.565
Non-goals: stock availability caching (a hint only, 10 s TTL); search results (Ch 22).

