618
00:30:07.740 --> 00:30:08.935
Proposed design.

619
00:30:09.215 --> 00:30:10.388
L1 Caffeine:

620
00:30:10.668 --> 00:30:19.585
5 s TTL, W-TinyLFU, ~10 K entries, get(key, loader) single-flight, and eviction by per-pod Kafka broadcast.

621
00:30:19.865 --> 00:30:38.639
L2 Redis: values stored as version, payload with a set-if-newer Lua script, invalidation via version tombstones written by an invalidator consuming outbox events, XFetch early refresh, TTL with jitter (cards 6 h, prices 10 min), and hot keys replicated times 8.

622
00:30:39.989 --> 00:30:55.669
CDN: product images with immutable versioned URLs; anonymous category listings with s-maxage=30, stale-while-revalidate=60, tagged by surrogate keys (sku-id, category-id) and purged on change.

623
00:30:55.949 --> 00:31:02.754
Warming: at Tminus 30 min, a job loads the sale SKU list times stores into L2 (throttled).

624
00:31:03.034 --> 00:31:04.527
Flushing is prohibited.

625
00:31:04.807 --> 00:31:07.239
Price reloads publish change events instead.

626
