00:40:24.695 --> 00:40:28.855
It runs to 119 lines; the full listing is in the chapter.

776
00:40:29.135 --> 00:40:36.644
L1 (Caffeine, per pod, 5 s), then L2 (versioned Redis), then loader (DB) guarded by a per-pod semaphore.

777
00:40:36.924 --> 00:40:41.767
Caffeine.get(key, fn) is atomic per key, then single-flight within the pod.

778
00:40:42.047 --> 00:40:47.721
XFetch on L2 soft expiry, then one early refresh before the key actually expires.

779
00:40:50.571 --> 00:40:51.318
