780
00:40:51.598 --> 00:40:53.859
Why computeMs goes into the entry.

781
00:40:54.139 --> 00:40:56.870
XFetch refreshes slower-to-compute keys earlier.

782
00:40:57.150 --> 00:41:04.553
Storing the last compute time with the value lets every pod make the same probabilistic decision with no coordination.

783
00:41:05.903 --> 00:41:07.780
