1321
01:12:52.957 --> 01:12:58.759
Personalized responses: private or no-store at the edge; L2 keyed per user if needed.

1322
01:13:00.109 --> 01:13:02.755
Decisions (price at checkout, stock, payment):

1323
01:13:03.035 --> 01:13:04.784
System of record, not cache.

